10e. maintainers' own comment on recovery: /usr/local is a tmpfs overlay, so the sentinel is never found and the FirstBoot hooks run on every boot

-- https://github.com/kairos-io/kairos/blob/v4.4.0/kairos-init/pkg/bundled/cloudconfigs/09_openrc_services.yaml#L81-L89
    81	    # The agent is the one service recovery must not get. 02_agent.yaml guards
    82	    # kairos-agent.service with the same condition on systemd, and agent.Run
    83	    # has no recovery check of its own: in recovery /usr/local is the tmpfs
    84	    # overlay, so the firstboot sentinel is never found, the FirstBoot hooks
    85	    # run on every recovery boot, GrubFirstBootOptions rewrites the OEM
    86	    # grubenv, and the bootstrap event asks the provider to bring up a cluster
    87	    # on a throwaway rootfs.
    88	    - name: "Create the OpenRC kairos-agent service"
    89	      if: '[ ! -f "/run/cos/recovery_mode" ]'

